  Prey: {fileID: 0}
  Count: 300
  RewardCoins: 150
  Unlocks: east_clearing
  Offer: 'Past the east clearing there''s a pine forest, better hunting than here. Fallen trees block the way. Earn me 300 coins in trade and I''ll get them cleared. Mind you, past the trees the land drops away in steep slopes: you''ll have to surf down.'
  Task: Earn 300 coins selling your catch
  Waiting: Keep it coming. The forest won't wait forever.
  Done: 'Done. The way east is clear. Ride the slopes down to the pines, and don''t fall: it''s a long climb back. There''s a way home from the forest camp.'
  Order: 4
